<h1>Demerike &quot;Demi&quot; Palecek</h1>
<p>Illinois House, 13th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.demiforillinois.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (demiforillinois.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Lists affordable housing (rent stabilization, tenant protections, SRO preservation), healthcare and mental health access, reproductive freedom, public school funding including universal pre-K, union rights and fair wages, and climate investment as priorities. Supports a graduated income tax and ethics reforms such as barring legislators from outside lobbying work.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Marketing and communications consultant and Army National Guard member (previously U.S. Air Force Security Forces), former communications manager for state Rep. Stephanie Kifowit, and president of the 46th Ward Democrats.</p>
